Package: labwc
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, xwayland
Suggests: foot | x-terminal-emulator, kanshi, swaybg, swayidle
Description: Wayland window-stacking compositor (backport for Querencia)
 labwc is a wlroots-based window-stacking compositor for Wayland,
 inspired by Openbox.
 .
 This is upstream labwc 0.9.8 rebuilt for Ubuntu 26.04 by the Querencia
 project: Ubuntu 26.04 ships 0.9.3, whose layer-shell popups get no
 keyboard focus (Querencia's panel menus need 0.9.4 or newer).
